This repository incorporates and modifies V2EX Plus 2.1.3 GPLv3 code.
The complete GNU GPL v3 text is included at:

  formant/v2ex-plus/COPYING

The V2EX Plus attribution and integration notice is included at:

  formant/v2ex-plus/NOTICE

This repository also incorporates a public-repository integration derived from
GitZip for github 1.0.5 (MIT):

  Project: https://github.com/KinoLien/gitzip
  GitZip license and modification notice: formant/gitzip/LICENSE and
  formant/gitzip/NOTICE
  Upstream dependency attribution: formant/gitzip/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES

The GitZip public-mode integration excludes GitHub token/OAuth flows and uses
browser-native ZIP/download APIs instead of redistributing its original JSZip,
Pako, and FileSaver.js bundles.

This repository also incorporates AutoPagerize 0.3.9 by swdyh
(GPL core script + MIT extension abstraction):

  Project: http://autopagerize.net/
  License and modification notice: formant/autopagerize/LICENSE and
  formant/autopagerize/NOTICE

The AutoPagerize core XPath, scroll-detection, and DOM insertion logic is
GPL-licensed and compatible with formant's GPLv3 distribution. The wedata.net
auto-update endpoint is removed; a bundled siteinfo dataset serves as the
site-rule source.

